  "description": "“Can I squeeze a ride in?” “Do I have the legs to see where this side road goes?” “A ride would feel great, but do I have the energy?” Confluence Flat Bar CUES 11 answers these questions with an “Oh yeah.” Its MAHLE hub-drive system delivers 40Nm of electric assist to give you the extra push you need to ride more. Confluence’s geometry is designed specifically for the extra comfort and confidence you want for riding gravel ebikes at higher average speeds on sketchy roads. The aluminum frame and carbon fork balance weight, comfort, and performance. Cargo and fender mounts let you configure your Confluence your way. The Shimano CUES 11-speed drivetrain tops it all off with smooth shifting and massive gear range. Charge Your Adventure with Confluence Flat Bar CUES 11.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
